  "notes": "{合|あ}わせる is an ichidan verb meaning to combine, match, or adjust things together.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Pair: {合|あ}う (intransitive, to match/fit)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {時計|とけい}を{合|あ}わせる: to set a clock/watch\n- {力|ちから}を{合|あ}わせる: to combine efforts\n- {目|め}を{合|あ}わせる: to make eye contact\n- {予定|よてい}を{合|あ}わせる: to coordinate schedules\n- {手|て}を{合|あ}わせる: to put hands together (pray)\n- {話|はなし}を{合|あ}わせる: to get stories straight\n\nCOMPOUND VERBS:\n- {問|と}い{合|あ}わせる: to inquire\n- {組|く}み{合|あ}わせる: to combine\n- {打|う}ち{合|あ}わせる: to discuss (meeting)",
